+/**
+ * Raw ref plumbing for the hidden `refs/omp/…` namespace. The native layer's
+ * `createBranch`/`deleteBranch` hardcode `refs/heads/` (gitoxide-side), so
+ * refs outside that namespace go through the git CLI — the binary upstream
